description:
This repository includes the code for a hybrid structural HRTF model combining measured, synthesised, and selected components. In particular, its three components are: 


	 A generic head-and-torso component, taken from the "pinna-less" KEMAR set included in the Viking HRTF dataset v2 with ITD removed (measured component); 
	 A fully customized pinna component, built using features related to the shape of the user’s pinnae through deep learning (synthesized component); 
